<title>INDIA: Indian sugar market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indian sugar market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian sugar market was closed on Friday for a national holiday.</p>
<p>Expectations of a pick-up in festival demand will keep prices firm, dealers said.</p>
<p>On Thursday, ready delivery sugar S-30 rose eight rupees to 1,280/1,313 per quintal and M-30 gained 5/15 to 1,320/1,375. Sugar mill delivery gained five rupees to 1,220/1,230.</p>
<p>--Bombay Commodities +91-22-265-9000</p>
